     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Organisation example-ihe-france-pam-organization</b></p><a name=\"example-ihe-france-pam-organization\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-ihe-france-pam-organization\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ihe-france-pam-organization.html\">IHE France PAM Organization</a></p></div><p style=\"border: 1px #661aff solid; background-color: #e6e6ff; padding: 10px;\">Centre Hospitalier Exemple (urn:example:finess#120456789)</p><hr/></div>"
